Package: toastmaker
Title: Personal Project Setup Toolbox
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Tomáš", "Marťák", , "tomas.martak@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Small helpers for day-to-day analysis work in R. Creates a
    standard project directory tree (analysis, raw, img, doc, scripts),
    removes the directories that stayed empty, reports what a script
    produced, and tidies the global environment while keeping the
    objects you care about.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/tomasmartak/toastmaker
BugReports: https://github.com/tomasmartak/toastmaker/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Suggests:
    beepr,
    renv,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
